<span data-as=3D"p"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Semantic_memor=
y" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noreferrer" class=3D"link">Semantic memory</a>,=
 both in humans and AI agents, involves the retention of specific facts and=
 concepts. In humans, it can include information learned in school and the =
understanding of concepts and their relationships. For AI agents, semantic =
memory is often used to personalize applications by remembering facts or co=
ncepts from past interactions.</span>
