<span data-as=3D"p">Regardless of memory management approach, the central p=
oint is that the agent will use the semantic memories to <a class=3D"link" =
href=3D"https://docs.langchain.com/oss/python/langchain/retrieval">ground i=
ts responses</a>, which often leads to more personalized and relevant inter=
actions.</span>
<h3 class=3D"flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id=3D"episodic-m=
emory"><div class=3D"absolute" tabindex=3D"-1"><a href=3D"https://docs.lang=
chain.com/oss/python/concepts/memory#episodic-memory" class=3D"-ml-10 flex =
